/></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Resonance\" title=\"Resonance\">Resonance +59</a>:</b> Passive: +59 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Sonic <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Cacophonic_Verge.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Cacophonic_Verge.png/420px-Cacophonic_Verge.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"569\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Cacophonic_Verge.png 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Epic_Cacophonic_Verge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Epic Cacophonic Verge\">Epic Cacophonic Verge</a> \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><i>A thin rod of blackened wood containing charges of the Sonic Blast spell. Eternal wands recharge over time if they are not actively being used.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">This wand recharges exceptionally quickly, at a rate of about 2 seconds per charge. This makes it effectively impossible to run out of charges.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817153844\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nP